---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const lang = "en" as const;
const TELEFON = "+40 741 387 026";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Entry without internet"
  lang={lang}
  description="How to enter a dog in CFC-Royal shows without a computer or e-mail address: by phone, on paper or in person."
>
  <div class="container fni">
    <h1>Entry without internet</h1>
    <p>
      No computer or e-mail address? The association registry can enter your dog <b>on your
      behalf</b>: call the registry{TELEFON ? <> at <b>{TELEFON}</b></> : <span> (phone number to be announced)</span>}
      with the dog's papers at hand, or download the paper form, fill it in, sign it and send a
      photo of it via WhatsApp, by post, or hand it in at your member club, together with proof
      of payment.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/documente/formulare/inscriere-expozitie-pe-hartie.pdf" download>
        Download the paper entry form (PDF, in Romanian)
      </a>
    </p>
    <p>
      The fee is paid in advance at any bank counter or by postal order to the organiser's
      account announced for the show. Instead of e-mail confirmations, the registry calls you
      by phone — once after validation and once with your catalogue number.
    </p>
    <p>
      Have internet access after all? The <a href="/en/inscriere-expozitie/">online form</a> is the fastest way.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .fni { padding-block: 3rem; max-width: 46rem; }
</style>
